峰結華の２人。\n・２人ともケロンスーツという宇宙服を着て、ヘルメットも被った状態。\n・海に潜る直前／海に潜っている最中／海から出てきた後のいずれかの場面という想定。\n・参考画像のようにホースを通して空気が送られる仕組み。（お互いを繋ぐホースは短めだと嬉しいです）\n・両者とも何かしらの感情を示している。（困惑する、嬉しがる、意地悪そうに振る舞う、心配する、など）\n\n【参考画像】\n他の方のイラストを掲載いたします。\nhttps://skeb.jp/@O_su_42/works/4\nhttps://skeb.jp/@343rone/works/13\nhttps://skeb.jp/@shirofox/works/25", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@krmn_aru/works/4", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/629d66d2/uploads/origins/b0cce74e-8c62-45bc-93b2-7f0e5d042b21?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=aafc9a5217b9175a1d193147a8c60bab", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/629d66d2/uploads/origins/b0cce74e-8c62-45bc-93b2-7f0e5d042b21?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=aafc9a5217b9175a1d193147a8c60bab, https://si.imgix.net/629d66d2/uploads/origins/b0cce74e-8c62-45bc-93b2-7f0e5d042b21?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3393991e5f53295e46ce22287c55061d 2x, https://si.imgix.net/629d66d2/uploads/origins/b0cce74e-8c62-45bc-93b2-7f0e5d042b21?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3615651bdc86ee0c781c3f3574ba8980 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Thank you very much for the very nice Kirimine illustration last time.\nThis time, I would like to ask for an illustration of Kiriko sleeping peacefully with Mimine's heartbeat.\nIn contrast to Kiriko, I would be more than happy if Mimine is a little nervous and unable to sleep.\nIf possible, I would like them both to be in private dress down, and I will leave the background to you.\nPlease consider this if you like.", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@krmn_aru/works/3", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/72e76136/uploads/origins/0e02dd90-28a3-4ca4-86eb-b0b4c17b0439?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2c3ca7d9c3611b5fd11dc05fa11bca48", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/72e76