\"NOT≠EQUAL\". (If Mimine has other costumes that fit better, that's fine too.)\n\nThank you for your consideration.\nKirimine, I have it.", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@krmn_aru/works/1", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/bf423b9e/uploads/origins/c2bf56d1-bd56-41ae-b1fe-c889d2a417de?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=51fa8d09dd7a4d28c14b73a8f6f3bc1f", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/bf423b9e/uploads/origins/c2bf56d1-bd56-41ae-b1fe-c889d2a417de?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=51fa8d09dd7a4d28c14b73a8f6f3bc1f, https://si.imgix.net/bf423b9e/uploads/origins/c2bf56d1-bd56-41ae-b1fe-c889d2a417de?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=20bffbbb6f480caab206e73a15f4e243 2x, https://si.imgix.net/bf423b9e/uploads/origins/c2bf56d1-bd56-41ae-b1fe-c889d2a417de?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fe77536373bef9a112f6d807b492a565 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "I've asked for a Kirimine for \"Two seconds before Kiriko, who couldn't wait another year, deliciously eats Mimine\".\nI'd like to ask you to draw Kirimine in \"Two seconds before Kiriko, who couldn't wait another year to eat Mimine\".\nIf you like, please consider it.", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}]}